    "description": {
      "value": "**Trigger:** A living creature within range would die.\n\nYour blessing revives a creature at the moment of its death. You prevent the target from dying and restore 5d8 Hit Points to the target. You can't use breath of life if the triggering effect was disintegrate or a death effect."
    },
